{"unit_id":"LuckVd__dsh-btw#card-zh","repo":"LuckVd/dsh-btw","commit":"01266d7e20765d9406624ebd9be803bca95125f2","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-btw 是面向 DSH Web 的侧问面板插件：它在界面侧栏中为当前对话提供独立提问入口。用户可从某条回答的问号按钮发起锚定追问，也可用 Ctrl/⌘+Alt+B 打开面板；插件把当前窗口已完成的对话文本作为只读参考，创建单独会话并流式显示回答，不把内容写入主会话。它还支持按回答续接各自的侧问历史、切换侧问模型与查看上下文占用。适合希望就当前讨论快速追问、同时保持主会话整洁的 DSH Web 用户。配置可覆盖侧问 preset、模型提供方、模型和推理强度，默认值已提供。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:288-355","lib/client.js:562-577","lib/client.js:687-719","lib/client.js:1091-1173"]}
{"unit_id":"LuckVd__dsh-btw#card-en","repo":"LuckVd/dsh-btw","commit":"01266d7e20765d9406624ebd9be803bca95125f2","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-btw adds a side-ask panel to DSH Web. Open it from an assistant reply or press Ctrl/Cmd+Alt+B to ask with completed chat text as context. It creates a separate session and streams answers outside the main chat. Users can resume side threads per reply, choose a model, and view context usage.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:288-355","lib/client.js:562-577","lib/client.js:687-719","lib/client.js:1091-1173"]}
